---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Chronicle
description: A source-led civic briefing from Niyantran.
interactiveReaders: true
---
{% set lead = collections.leads | head %}
{% set dataBriefs = collections.dataBriefs %}
{% set supporting = collections.storyList %}
{% include "components/ad-slot.njk" %}
{% include "components/masthead.njk" %}
<main id="content" class="editorial">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <header class="issue-intro">
      <p class="issue-intro__kicker">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
      <h1>Debunking the Monsoon Session 2026</h1>
      <p>The session never properly began. So we read the one record it did leave behind — <strong>7,825 Parliamentary Questions</strong>, filed over 19 sitting days, across both Houses. This is what Parliament asked. And what it never got round to asking at all.</p>
    </header>
    {% if lead %}
      <section aria-labelledby="lead-heading">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="lead-heading">The lead</h2>
          <span>{{ site.issue }}</span>
        </div>
        {% include "components/story-lead.njk" %}
      </section>
    {% endif %}
    {% if dataBriefs.length %}
      <section class="data-section" aria-labelledby="data-heading">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="data-heading">On the record</h2>
          <span>Four readings from the session</span>
        </div>
        <div class="data-board">
          {% for article in dataBriefs %}
            {% include "components/data-brief.njk" %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endif %}
    {% if supporting.length %}
      <section class="latest" aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="latest-heading">Also in the issue</h2>
          <span>{{ supporting.length }} stories</span>
        </div>
        {% for article in supporting %}
          {% include "components/story-row.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </section>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</main>
<section class="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="site-shell why__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--red">Why this exists</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="why-title">Every story here came off one screen.</h2>
      <p>Chronicle is the public face of <strong>Niyantran</strong> — a terminal that watches India's Parliament, courts, markets and public money on one board, from the union cabinet down to the ward. Each edition opens up one more of its screens. When the countdown reaches zero, you get all of them.</p>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="#signup-title">Join the waitlist</a>
      <span>Early sign-ups get 30% off at launch</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "components/signup.njk" %}
{% include "components/footer.njk" %}
{% include "components/interactive-readers.njk" %}

